UgxikizIwasvJ5w-v314AaABAg,,False,@syikinah,"[I'm sorry for my bad grammar, please do correct me if there's anything wrong or any mistakes with my sentences (⁠｡⁠•́⁠︿⁠•̀⁠｡⁠)]

It has been 9 months since this episode got uploaded. I was a BTS fan for 4 years (2017 - 2021) but only until the early of 2021. During that 4 years, I filled my teen years with them, and it was a wonderful journey to be a part of their fans (⁠ ⁠◜⁠‿⁠◝⁠ ⁠)⁠♡ I have never been to any of their concert, but watching them performing through this virtual screen, I realized how much they've gone through for them to get this big. Remembering that, I feel really proud of them, even to this day when I'm no longer a part of their fan, which is ARMY. 

One thing that I always looked up to BTS, even to this day, is their ""friendship"" ~ Their friendship will forever be something that I always love about them. Knowing that they've been living together for more than 10 years, I can't convert my feeling into words to describe how much I love their strong bond towards each other (⁠≧⁠▽⁠≦⁠)

This comment might seem pretty random to read, but thank you for your time for reading this thing (⁠ ⁠╹⁠▽⁠╹⁠ ⁠) Back then, ARMYs are my online friends that I can share my opinion and thoughts without any worries  >_< thank you for always be there for me, both ARMY and BTS (and to all the staff that work behind the scene with them~)  May success and happiness be along with you forever towards the future that you have always dreamed 💜

