UgzZ-BxzMuYFLfT2AGh4AaABAg,,False,@shockofthenew,"I seriously love these episodes so much. Relaxed, mature, warm-hearted conversations between old friends. Seokjin has really taught me a lot over the years... his personality is very different from mine, so I get amazed by his perspective sometimes. Saying ""just live in the moment, love yourself, be happy"" are words which don't have much meaning by themselves, but Seokjin demonstrates by example how to live up to these words, which is something that's actually very challenging for many of us to do. At the same time, living in the moment doesn't mean everything is relaxed and easy, it's actually about commitment to doing the best you can with what you have at the time. He's been able to show the amazing results of hard work and continuous effort, growing from someone who started with no experience and no confidence into a truly amazing performer.

Ah... if anyone was to ever doubt that Bangtan are the driving force behind their own careers and their own success, they only need to watch these interviews and it's so clear these are intelligent, thoughtful, hardworking professionals with a great attitude and an amazing team dynamic which has become a brotherhood!",77,2023-12-08T01:59:22Z,2023-12-08T01:59:22Z
