Ugz5g6WEIHoWz6l2dnt4AaABAg,,False,@KootchLB,"This is my favourite Suchwita episode and not only because I love SIN, that intro seals the deal. knowing that Jin asked for the episode to be aired when he can watch it with his unit and the company timing the release for FESTA. I love how Yoongi always pulled Jin up every time he downplayed his own talents and role in the team. And how he repeatedly brought up the fact that Jin is the only one in the group who completed a four-year degree, and from a university with strict admission criteria. Yoongi has always been a masterful host, even from the early days of his emceeing their FESTA celebrations and he has been impressive in the Suchwita series. The story behind Jin's performance at the Coldplay concert, Jin's foray into traditional Korean alcohol, the memorable 2018 MAMA acceptance speech and the heartwarming revelation of their life as roomies and bandmates - all nourishment for my Jin-starved heart. Jin calls himself a simple man and says he only wants to be happy, but this episode reveals the depth and complexity of the engagement necessary to achieve this happiness. Hobi provided a lovely splash of sunshine, and he is also missed very much.",52,2023-07-06T07:47:25Z,2023-07-06T07:47:25Z
