UgzAl5aDghZv7oYpood4AaABAg,,False,@archeiafaith,"Yoongi has a special relationship with every member but his relationship with Jin is absolutely endearing. In none of the episodes Suga got up to welcome any of the member but he did for Jin because not only he is older to Suga but also because Suga respects Jin a lot. You can see how much Suga wants to learn Jin's ways. When it comes to others, he simply shares their mutual experiences or appreciates the guest's hard work but in Jin's case, he really wants to become more like him. 
When guests appear on the show, Suga is usually the quiet one. He would ask the question and naturally encourage the guest to speak (even if its members) but in this episode he is happy to continuously speak while Jin continues eating. Like this is not a typical broadcast for them. Its just having a meal with his favorite and only hyung. He won't have this chance for the next two years so he wants to make the best out of it and it also shows us that between both of them, Suga is a talker and Jin is a silent listener",245,2023-06-12T15:23:25Z,2023-06-12T15:23:25Z
